WEBVTT

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.320
They're climbing the waterfall.

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:14.670
They say if an inugami can climb 
a waterfall, it's all grown up.

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:15.710
Really?

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:17.030
Don't give up!

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:21.790
Hey!

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:24.970
Have you seen a suspicious man come by?

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:27.170
A man? I haven't.

00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:31.650
Mii-kun?

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:35.100
Mii-kun?!

00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:38.050
Sorabou, where are you going?

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:41.140
Yamada-san...

00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:43.110
Mii-kun...

00:00:43.990 --> 00:00:45.810
I can't find Mii-kun.

00:00:46.090 --> 00:00:47.310
Say what?

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:48.560
It can't be...

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:53.490
An uninvited human has 
snuck into the festival.

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:57.320
It may be that human's doing.

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:06.130
People come and go, sooner or later.

00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:11.250
I've been preparing myself to accept it, 
whenever it happens.

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:15.540
<i>Mii-kun's going to be gone?</i>

00:02:47.590 --> 00:02:49.890
Don't worry, Sorabou.

00:02:50.150 --> 00:02:52.300
The guards are going after the man.

00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:55.780
No one suspicious is ever 
going to leave the forest.

00:02:56.420 --> 00:02:57.650
Yamada-san...

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:01.680
The land god protects this forest.

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:04.150
You don't need to get so pale.

00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:13.880
Is it a collector?

00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:16.800
I believe so.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:22.090
Yamada-san, what's that sound?

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:24.080
It's the guard team's signal.

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:26.190
They must have lost the man.

00:03:26.190 --> 00:03:27.180
No!

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:29.640
W-We have to go find him.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:30.850
I have to go.

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:33.080
Mii-kun! Mii-kun!

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:35.580
Stay calm, Kashiwagi.

00:03:36.470 --> 00:03:39.150
Hopefully we can find out where he is.

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:41.380
What?

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:43.070
Oh, I mean, that thing.

00:03:44.010 --> 00:03:44.660
What thing?

00:03:45.190 --> 00:03:48.180
The thing that the god at 
Outotsu Shrine put on him...

00:03:48.530 --> 00:03:50.540
Didn't they say it was a tag?

00:03:57.440 --> 00:04:00.420
Maybe we can find Mii-kun with it, then.

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:01.750
Right.

00:04:02.060 --> 00:04:02.970
In that case...

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:07.430
Mii-kun!

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:17.440
This isn't something you find every day.

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:19.590
You're going to make me some good money.

00:04:20.490 --> 00:04:22.150
A mummy child?

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:23.700
So soft.

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:26.820
What's going on inside?

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:29.690
Where's the end of the bandage?

00:04:31.650 --> 00:04:33.040
Quit squirming!

00:04:33.310 --> 00:04:35.830
Mii-kun!

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:39.160
Mii-kun!

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:48.610
Mii-kun!

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:54.420
It's no good, nothing's happening.

00:04:58.210 --> 00:04:58.940
Up there.

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:15.370
I can't see anything.

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:18.750
Mii's <i>shikigami</i> is in the air.

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:23.050
You can see that far, Tazukinbou?

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:28.530
The thin thread on the shikigami

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:31.640
is coming out of the forest 
above the waterfall.

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:34.700
Yamada-san, how do we get 
to the top of the waterfall?

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:38.340
You have to go back to the 
festival reception area.

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:39.770
He's going to get away.

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:43.640
You can't be serious.

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:47.820
The quickest way to get there is by climbing 
up those rocks to the side of the waterfall.

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:52.180
No, no, no. That's not happening!

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:55.050
Tazuki, can I ask you to give me support?

00:05:55.050 --> 00:05:55.750
Yeah.

00:05:56.260 --> 00:05:58.760
Do you see the slightly pale-colored rock?

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:01.580
Put your foot there.

00:06:02.010 --> 00:06:04.640
There's less moss there.

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:06.010
It shouldn't slip as much.

00:06:06.810 --> 00:06:07.690
Got it.

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:13.010
Sora-chan, come here.

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:15.500
I'll throw you as high as I can.

00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:17.640
B-But...

00:06:18.090 --> 00:06:19.650
We have to save Mii-kun.

00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:23.650
Thanks, Mogi-chan.

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:27.240
Here I go.

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:27.780
Go!

00:06:34.070 --> 00:06:35.390
You did it!

00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:37.910
Not only are you cute, 
you're really strong, too.

00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:55.810
<i>Hold on, Mii-kun, I'm coming.</i>

00:06:56.090 --> 00:06:57.670
Go, Sorabou.

00:06:58.080 --> 00:07:00.810
Is that really a human child?

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:04.820
Shoot!

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:08.940
Kashiwagi!

00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:21.710
Aa and Uu saved Sorabou 
by climbing the waterfall!

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:24.380
What? The cleansing waterfall?!

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:25.540
Damn!

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:31.430
Uu's slowing down the oncoming water, 
and Aa is climbing behind him.

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:32.960
They're completely in sync.

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:35.180
They're perfect together.

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:46.140
Thanks, Aa-kun, Uu-kun.

00:07:48.740 --> 00:07:49.690
Mii-kun.

00:07:54.330 --> 00:07:55.830
What the hell is this string?

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:57.410
I can't break it.

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:58.450
Damn it.

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:08.900
You aren't getting away.

00:08:09.370 --> 00:08:10.290
Stop!

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:13.480
Give back Mii-kun!

00:08:15.290 --> 00:08:16.940
Who the hell are you?

00:08:16.940 --> 00:08:17.510
A human?

00:08:23.180 --> 00:08:26.060
What the hell is wrong with you?!
You little...

00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:28.960
Give back Mii-kun!

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:32.530
Is Mii-kun this kid here?

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:33.400
Yeah.

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:38.190
What, you want him, too?

00:08:38.190 --> 00:08:41.040
Is that why you chased me so frantically?

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:45.000
Well, of course.

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:47.300
These things are good money.

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:49.360
That's not it.

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:51.420
That's not it!

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:55.020
Give back Mii-kun!

00:08:55.020 --> 00:08:56.010
You little brat!

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:01.390
What the hell is your problem?

00:09:01.650 --> 00:09:05.310
What good are these animals 
for other than money?

00:09:05.990 --> 00:09:07.080
Shut up.

00:09:08.470 --> 00:09:10.060
Give back Mii-kun.

00:09:10.840 --> 00:09:11.900
Mii-kun is...

00:09:12.530 --> 00:09:13.600
Mii-kun is...

00:09:14.270 --> 00:09:16.910
Mii-kun is my precious family!

00:09:17.130 --> 00:09:17.940
What?

00:09:17.940 --> 00:09:19.190
Family?

00:09:19.190 --> 00:09:20.400
What are you...

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:22.620
Foolish human...

00:09:23.440 --> 00:09:27.050
You will pay dearly for sullying my mountain.

00:09:30.110 --> 00:09:31.120
What the hell?!

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:34.920
Shoot!

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:37.230
Do you still not understand?

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.430
Mii-kun!

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:48.880
Mii-kun!

00:09:49.410 --> 00:09:50.160
Mii-kun!

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:51.360
Mii-kun!

00:09:52.640 --> 00:09:53.940
Mii-kun!

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:55.950
I'm so glad you're safe.

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:01.470
Mii-kun...

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:06.910
Damn it!

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:07.650
Let go!

00:10:07.650 --> 00:10:09.210
Let go of me!

00:10:09.620 --> 00:10:12.390
What shall we do with him, Land God?

00:10:12.810 --> 00:10:14.590
What else?

00:10:15.870 --> 00:10:20.470
A hundred lashes and burning.

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:26.650
Walk faster, damn it!

00:10:31.550 --> 00:10:32.560
Mii-kun...

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:35.620
Sorry you had to go through that.

00:10:36.090 --> 00:10:37.640
It's okay now.

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:47.330
What's that?

00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:50.220
A gift for you guys, Sorabou.

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:52.080
For us?

00:10:52.390 --> 00:10:55.630
You caught the uninvited guest.

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:57.800
You guys are kind of heroes.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:59.370
Heroes?

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:01.410
It's thanks to the land god.

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:06.720
Good for you, Mii-kun.

00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:10.530
Thanks guys.

00:11:10.530 --> 00:11:12.980
You helped save Mii-kun.

00:11:15.560 --> 00:11:17.810
Aa-kun, Uu-kun, thanks.

00:11:22.420 --> 00:11:25.660
This is a gift from the land god.

00:11:27.430 --> 00:11:29.410
We got word, too.

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:32.290
Sounds like you had a rough time.

00:11:32.490 --> 00:11:35.170
Your tag was awesome.

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:36.830
Thank you, god.

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:38.050
You really saved us.

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:41.430
Oh, right.

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:43.540
About the two Inugami...

00:11:43.540 --> 00:11:44.930
Aa-kun and Uu-kun?

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:46.260
Yeah.

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:49.380
The land god was quite impressed.

00:11:49.380 --> 00:11:52.190
They're going to be the 
guardians of Bachiyama.

00:11:53.030 --> 00:11:54.100
That's amazing.

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:55.810
That's a huge promotion.

00:11:56.710 --> 00:11:57.650
Wow.

00:11:59.420 --> 00:12:00.360
What?

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:03.930
Maybe he wants to play more.

00:12:03.930 --> 00:12:06.330
Mii-kun wasn't here with them today.

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:09.170
Okay, guys, want to come over?

00:12:14.550 --> 00:12:15.830
I'm home.

00:12:16.390 --> 00:12:17.920
Welcome home.

00:12:19.440 --> 00:12:21.450
Thanks for having us, Kaede-san.

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:22.510
Come in.

00:12:22.860 --> 00:12:24.070
Thank you.

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:24.780
Yup.

00:12:26.240 --> 00:12:27.500
Nice to meet you.

00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:29.470
My name is Tachiaki Daichi.

00:12:29.470 --> 00:12:31.730
I'm Sora's aunt, Kashiwagi Kaede.

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:34.090
Thank you for taking care of Sora-kun.

00:12:36.620 --> 00:12:38.000
What's the matter?

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:42.740
Oh, sorry, you just happened to 
look like a model that I like.

00:12:43.050 --> 00:12:45.410
A multi-talented creator named Kaede-sama.

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:47.570
Oh, that's her.

00:12:47.960 --> 00:12:49.200
Seriously?!

00:12:50.110 --> 00:12:51.790
I'm a huge fan!

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:54.100
Th-Thank you.

00:12:54.100 --> 00:12:55.750
I really love you.

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:56.410
Bah.

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:58.500
There.

00:12:58.730 --> 00:13:01.150
What's that, Soraino?

00:13:01.150 --> 00:13:02.900
A gift from the festival.

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:03.760
Festival?!

00:13:04.100 --> 00:13:05.650
You went to a festival?!

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:07.860
Which festival? Where?

00:13:07.860 --> 00:13:09.750
Hey, what are you doing?

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:11.640
I'm still talking!

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:20.320
I get it.

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:22.740
They're sulking.

00:13:24.200 --> 00:13:27.700
They're sulking because they 
didn't get to go to the festival.

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:30.700
Of course, I am, too!

00:13:36.560 --> 00:13:39.340
That's why you were kicking me earlier.

00:13:42.200 --> 00:13:43.960
I see.

00:13:44.120 --> 00:13:46.480
Sorry, Isao.

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:51.980
It wasn't on purpose that we didn't take you.

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:56.420
Don't get so upset.

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:57.730
I have a gift for all of you.

00:14:00.470 --> 00:14:01.950
What's wrong?

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:06.360
I received a small box and a big box.

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:12.080
In the folk tales, the big one 
tends to have dangerous things.

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:17.290
So that's why you gave 
the gods the smaller one.

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:24.000
I don't think it's anything bad, but just 
in case, can you stay back a little?

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:25.730
G-Got it.

00:14:40.450 --> 00:14:41.440
It's...

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:45.780
Shooting Gallery

00:14:47.160 --> 00:14:50.780
Who would have thought there'd 
be a festival set inside?

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:53.300
I can't believe it fit all this.

00:14:53.300 --> 00:14:54.280
Yeah.

00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:59.190
You look fantastic, everyone.

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:00.670
It suits you well.

00:15:01.050 --> 00:15:02.320
Kaede-san...

00:15:02.320 --> 00:15:04.040
Where did you get this?

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:07.670
I had these costumes from work.

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:10.130
Men's yukatas, too?

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:11.950
I thought something like this might happen.

00:15:13.540 --> 00:15:15.750
I've never worn a yukata before.

00:15:15.750 --> 00:15:17.580
You look really good.

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:18.730
Really?

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:20.370
You're cute, too, Mogi-chan.

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:21.490
Really?

00:15:21.490 --> 00:15:22.650
Yay.

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:25.070
What about Conny and them?

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:27.910
It's time for a festival!

00:15:31.570 --> 00:15:34.070
So cute! So cute! So cute!
So cute! So cute!

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:37.340
Sh-Sh-Show me some more!

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:44.160
Nice, it's like a real festival.

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:46.590
Did you have these, too?

00:15:46.780 --> 00:15:49.340
No, Sora-kun...

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:50.590
I made these.

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:51.740
What?!

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:53.030
When did you do that?

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:55.970
While Kaede-san was preparing the yukatas.

00:15:56.200 --> 00:15:59.210
You're way too high-spec, Sora-kun.

00:15:59.630 --> 00:16:00.730
You think so?

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:03.980
<b>Lot strings</b>

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:03.980
Which one do you want, Mukumuku?

00:16:05.970 --> 00:16:07.980
Okay, this one, right?

00:16:10.790 --> 00:16:12.980
Well, let's see what you win.

00:16:17.400 --> 00:16:19.150
Ow...

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:20.310
What's this?

00:16:20.810 --> 00:16:21.640
Let's see...

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:22.710
Grand prize.

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:23.450
Grand prize?!

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:24.880
Good job, Mukumuku!

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:27.760
An ittan-momen's loincloth.

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:31.150
A loincloth is the grand prize?

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:34.200
That's kind of the ittan-momen itself.

00:16:34.450 --> 00:16:36.390
Wait, no!

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:38.520
It flew away.

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:45.170
Shooting gallery, huh?

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:50.650
Second Prize     First Prize

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:50.650
Third prize

00:16:48.340 --> 00:16:50.650
Hey, the targets started moving.

00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:53.270
They're shikigami.

00:16:53.690 --> 00:16:56.160
Looks like they aren't made for humans.

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:59.160
Dude, this is way too hard.

00:17:02.190 --> 00:17:03.680
You want to play first?

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:18.280
Calm down.

00:17:30.170 --> 00:17:32.440
A-Are you okay, Mii-kun?

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:34.550
You want first prize, don't you?

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:36.240
Hold on.

00:17:58.860 --> 00:18:00.910
Yeah? You like that?

00:18:01.250 --> 00:18:02.470
Good.

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:15.270
Are you going after that orange one?

00:18:16.550 --> 00:18:18.240
Let's do this together.

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:21.490
You're good at this.

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:31.250
Ready, and...

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:38.380
Good job, Isao.

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:40.020
You got lots.

00:18:41.970 --> 00:18:43.350
Soraino, in my mouth.

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:44.640
Put it in my mouth, please.

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:47.190
The yo-yo?

00:18:47.190 --> 00:18:48.070
Yes.

00:18:48.070 --> 00:18:51.900
I can't bounce it, so I'd like 
to know what it feels like.

00:18:58.760 --> 00:19:01.530
I see, yo-yos are explosive.

00:19:10.410 --> 00:19:11.430
Tazuki.

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:41.460
I hope this life goes on for a while.

00:19:45.840 --> 00:19:46.880
Mii-kun.

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:53.280
Hey...

00:19:54.850 --> 00:19:59.020
I want to go places with all of 
you over the summer break.

00:20:00.320 --> 00:20:02.870
We won't be able to once we graduate.

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:08.690
Not just this year, but next year, too.

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:11.370
And the year after.

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:14.270
Together, with all of you.

00:20:16.160 --> 00:20:18.430
I can't wait!

00:20:18.430 --> 00:20:19.610
Where should we go?

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:22.570
I guess summer means going to the beach.

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:23.830
Camping in the mountains!

00:20:23.830 --> 00:20:25.620
The hot springs would be nice, too.

00:20:25.880 --> 00:20:28.720
I request barbecue and fireworks!

00:20:29.530 --> 00:20:31.620
This is getting exciting.

00:20:31.930 --> 00:20:34.160
Let's do <i>all</i> of it.

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:38.790
Just next year and the year after?

00:20:40.980 --> 00:20:42.260
More, if we can.

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:43.680
Indefinitely.

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:47.220
Yeah.

00:20:48.210 --> 00:20:50.530
Where do you guys want to go?

00:20:51.120 --> 00:20:52.600
Let's see...

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:55.020
I'd love to go see the fireworks.

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:56.580
Good idea.

00:20:56.580 --> 00:20:58.040
A barbecue would be good, too.

00:20:58.040 --> 00:20:59.020
Nice.

00:20:59.260 --> 00:21:00.930
I want to eat lots of meat.

00:21:19.870 --> 00:21:21.990
Let's eat, Mii-kun.

00:21:25.650 --> 00:21:27.130
Time to eat.

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:40.580
Are you okay, Mii-kun?

00:21:51.150 --> 00:21:52.160
Thanks.

00:22:16.390 --> 00:22:19.860
Always Together

00:23:49.820 --> 00:23:52.940
<b>Thank you!</b>
